<title>MALAYSIA: ACP Industries 6-mth net up 19 pct.</title>
<headline>ACP Industries 6-mth net up 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   15.61	  vs	   13.12</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)  39.0	   vs	   33.0</p>
<p>    Turnover	    160.71	  vs	   97.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     23.40	  vs	   16.37</p>
<p>    Minorities (less)   3.01	  vs   (add)  0.02</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the company is ACP Industries Bhd. The company is involved in the manufacture of pre-cast concrete pipes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
